  "restContentHtml": "<p>On this project, The Complete Restoration Company had many different substrates and surfaces to restore, each requiring their own very specific treatment.</p>\n<p>Our versatile <a href=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/services/doff/\">Doff machine</a> was used to clean a number of surfaces &#8211; the hot water blasting treatment helped bring the Portland stone treads and risers back to their best, and its steam setting helped us clean and polish the glazed bricks in the foyer.</p>\n<p>The terrazzo floors in reception were carefully cut back to their original finish and then re-polished.</p>\n<p>Next to be restored were the bronze balustrades that lined the four flights of stairs. They hadn’t been cleaned for some time, but a good polish and re-lacquer soon made them look as good as new.</p>\n<p>And finally, the top landings and flight of stairs had been finished in a parquet floor that had been neglected for years. <a href=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk\">The Complete Restoration Company</a> re-fitted any loose blocks, sanded then polished them with three coats of a polytec hard wax oil.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-1983\" src=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img3-300x225.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img3-300x225.png 300w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img3-768x577.png 768w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img3-1024x769.png 1024w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img3-618x464.png 618w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img3-100x75.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /> <img class=\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-1982\" src=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img1-300x199.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"199\" srcset=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img1-300x199.png 300w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img1-768x509.png 768w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img1-1024x679.png 1024w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img1-618x410.png 618w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img1-100x66.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></p>\n",
  "restExcerptHtml": "<p>On this project, The Complete Restoration Company had many different substrates and surfaces to restore, each requiring their own very specific treatment. Our versatile Doff machine was used to clean a number of surfaces &#8211; the hot water blasting treatment helped bring the Portland stone treads and risers back to their best, and its steam&#8230;.</p>\n",
  "renderedHtml": "</div> \n    </div>\n <div class=\"main-container\">\n<section class=\"row\" id=\"row_blog\" style=\"margin-top:0;\">\n    <div class=\"wrapper\">  \t\n\t<div id=\"primary-single\" class=\"site-content\">\n\t\t<div id=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n \t\t\t<article id=\"post-1675\" class=\"single-article complete-restoration-single-article\">\n                <img width=\"2098\" height=\"1396\" src=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img2.png\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img2.png 2098w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img2-300x200.png 300w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img2-768x511.png 768w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img2-1024x681.png 1024w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img2-618x411.png 618w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img2-100x67.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2098px) 100vw, 2098px\" />                \n\t\t<h1 class=\"post-title-single title align-center complete-restoration-single\">Imperial Science Collage</h1>\n                  <h2 class=\"entry-title align-center complete-restoration-single-h2\"> As one of the foremost teaching and research institutions, the Imperial College of Science wanted to restore the foyer and staircase back to its original beauty and to retain its grandeur.</h2>\t\t\t\n        <div class=\"post-wrapper-single complete-restoarion-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>On this project, The Complete Restoration Company had many different substrates and surfaces to restore, each requiring their own very specific treatment.</p>\n<p>Our versatile <a href=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/services/doff/\">Doff machine</a> was used to clean a number of surfaces &#8211; the hot water blasting treatment helped bring the Portland stone treads and risers back to their best, and its steam setting helped us clean and polish the glazed bricks in the foyer.</p>\n<p>The terrazzo floors in reception were carefully cut back to their original finish and then re-polished.</p>\n<p>Next to be restored were the bronze balustrades that lined the four flights of stairs. They hadn’t been cleaned for some time, but a good polish and re-lacquer soon made them look as good as new.</p>\n<p>And finally, the top landings and flight of stairs had been finished in a parquet floor that had been neglected for years. <a href=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk\">The Complete Restoration Company</a> re-fitted any loose blocks, sanded then polished them with three coats of a polytec hard wax oil.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-1983\" src=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img3-300x225.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img3-300x225.png 300w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img3-768x577.png 768w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img3-1024x769.png 1024w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img3-618x464.png 618w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img3-100x75.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /> <img class=\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-1982\" src=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img1-300x199.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"199\" srcset=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img1-300x199.png 300w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img1-768x509.png 768w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img1-1024x679.png 1024w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img1-618x410.png 618w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/imperial-img1-100x66.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></p>\n\t\t                 </div>\n\t\t\t</article>\n                <div class=\"wrapper divcontact\" > \n <div class=\"homformdetail\"  style=\"background:#6e6e6d url(https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/form_bricks.svg);no-repeat;cover;\">\n         <div class=\"inner\">\n            <div id=\"landlords-column-content\" class=\"not-mobile1\">\n              <h2 id=\"form-title\" style=\"text-align:center;\">Get a quote today</h2>\n               <div role=\"form\" class=\"wpcf7\" id=\"wpcf7-f521-o1\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"screen-reader-response\"></div>\n<form action=\"/case-studies/imperialscience-collage/#wpcf7-f521-o1\" method=\"post\" class=\"wpcf7-form form-contact\" novalidate=\"novalidate\" id=\"form-contact\">\n<div style=\"display: none;\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7\" value=\"521\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_version\" value=\"5.1.3\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_locale\" value=\"en\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_unit_tag\" value=\"wpcf7-f521-o1\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_container_post\" value=\"0\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"g-recaptcha-response\" value=\"\" />\n</div>\n<p><span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap your-name\"><input type=\"text\" name=\"your-name\" value=\"\" size=\"40\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text wpcf7-validates-as-required enquiry-input\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Name:\" /></span><br />\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap your-email\"><input type=\"email\" name=\"your-email\" value=\"\" size=\"40\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text wpcf7-email wpcf7-validates-as-requ